# The writable vendor cache a checkout run creates beside Cargo.toml; the
# tracked, read-only seed is SRC/mac_vendors.seed.tsv (compiled in).
SRC/mac_vendors.tsv
SRC/mac_vendors.tsv.tmp
# A standalone `cargo check` writes this; the image builds from the engine's lock (PLAN-3397.01).
/SRC/Cargo.lock
